<title>USA: Liberty Tech adjusts 1996, Q4 results.</title>
<headline>Liberty Tech adjusts 1996, Q4 results.</headline>
<dateline>CONSHOHOCKEN, Pa. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liberty Technologies Inc said on Tuesday it adjusted its 1996 and fourth quarter results, reflecting in a reduction for both periods following an accounting change for an income tax benefit.</p>
<p>Liberty Technologies said its adjusted net losses are $879,000, or $0.18 a share, for the fourth quarter and $2.57 million, or $0.52 a share, for the year.</p>
<p>Previously, the company reported a fourth quarter profit of $10,000 and a year loss of $1.68 million, $0.34 a share.</p>
